From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 16:58:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] docs: T7 execution order for applying T6 and starting
 training

Self-contained instructions for the lower window: apply the T6 patch with a
three-way merge (the local branch and the patch both touch hybrid_env.py in
non-overlapping ways), verify the suite and the interface dimension, launch
the six training runs, and push the backlog that carries the T1 episode
artifacts the Pure MPC row depends on.

Also records the 262005 re-check on the frozen interface: the staged-approach
cells complete in 122.1 s against the 271.2 s the earlier interface needed,
and the rescue stays selective rather than filling the grid.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KfdW4y9TEkhu2Sc1bKnkER
